Z||000000||Shaun41178||04-18-2000||12:16 AM||||ok Well I was planning on going to Norwalk for a bit of drag racing but I now have to work fri night.  Well I don'thave to work fri night but I have to work till 6 on fir which means I won't be able to make it to TNT.  Well I could make it but it wouldn't be worht my drive and time for the little time that I would get to run.  Plus the way it looks now it will rain.  so for those of you plannign on going this fri, I regret that I am out.  however I will try to make the Wed drag and/or the TNT on fri the 28.  Anyoen else in the cleveland or any OH area want to go?  it would be cool to see some other Fieros there.  <P>Shaun||||reg||1
